  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KLTN.Game.Presentation.CardLoreProfile
  role: "H\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3"
  skillDescription: "[Chi ti\u1EBFt k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng]\r\n[Last Breath]\r\n- Khi
    ta ch\u1EBFt, r\xFAt 1 l\xE1 v\xE0 h\u1ED3i 2 m\xE1u cho b\u1EA1n."
  folklore: "Ta l\xE0 ma m\u1EB7t m\xE2m, c\xF2n g\u1ECDi qu\u1EF7 m\u1EB7t nia \u2014
    \u0111\u1EA7u ta to, d\u1EB9t nh\u01B0 chi\u1EBFc m\xE2m tr\xEAn m\u1ED9t th\xE2n
    h\xECnh nh\u1ECF. Ta xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n \u1EDF n\u01A1i hoang v\u1EAFng \u0111\u1EC3
    l\xE0m ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111i \u0111\xEAm kinh h\xE3i, m\u1EA5t v\xEDa."
